## Context

`skills/pick-ticket/SKILL.md` lines 60 and 82 reference a stale
`status closed — already-done` log verb pattern:

    Line 60: `status closed — already-done` log line in the ticket
    Line 82: `{ts} claude status closed — already-done` in one step.

The `status` verb was removed from the %erg v1 spec. The correct
verb emitted by `erg close` is `closed —` (see real ticket example:
`2026-05-08T15:38Z MinhHaDuong closed — completed — ...`).

This is the same anti-pattern fixed in ticket 0096 (AGENTS.md),
found during the celebrate sweep after merging PRs 112/113.

## Actions

In `skills/pick-ticket/SKILL.md`:
1. Line 60: replace `` `status closed — already-done` log line ``
   with `` `closed — already-done` log line ``
2. Line 82: replace `` `{ts} claude status closed — already-done` ``
   with `` `{ts} claude closed — already-done` ``

## Exit criteria

- `skills/pick-ticket/SKILL.md` contains no `status closed` phrase
- `erg check tickets/` passes
